e/test_helper.exs`** - Added route: `live \"/react-form-test\", ReactFormTestLive`\n\n### Verification\n- Vite build: successful (101 modules, new component included)\n- TypeScript: compiles clean\n- Unit tests: 384/384 passing\n- Elixir compilation: clean (28 files)\n- E2E tests: cannot run locally due to pre-existing NixOS Playwright/chromium shared library issue (same issue affects all existing E2E tests in this environment)\n\n<promise>COMPLETE</promise>"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":306,"cache_read_input_tokens":87898,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":306},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8cfcad3f-3a06-41f0-92cb-a7a9566506cd","uuid":"257d5451-fe4f-45f3-981d-29a2808c9c6f"}
